4:       {'angle_crop_min': 135.0}
4:       {'angle_crop_max': 225.0}
4:       which is [135.0, 225.0], angle unit is degress.
4: - Serial port communication mode or network port communication mode configuration
4:   --enable serial communication mode:
4:   {'enable_serial_or_network_communication': True}
4:   --enable network communication mode:
4:   {'enable_serial_or_network_communication': False}
